================================================================================
SUPERSEDED / DO NOT APPLY (2026-09-05)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
This "AllocFixed re-reserve = no-op success" patch was REVERTED because it is
the root cause of the D3D12/Vulkan main-menu crash. Fable 2 branches on the
re-reserve result: success re-initializes its memory pools and NULLs the
free-list head, crashing at the main menu (sub_83231BE8 -> sub_832304E8).
The stock v0.10.0 behavior (re-reserve fails -> X_STATUS_NO_MEMORY) is what
the game needs. See docs/main_menu_crash_fix.md and
sdk_mainmenu_crash_fix.patch (the current, correct state of the SDK).
The diff below is kept only as a historical record of the bad change.
================================================================================

